#### Secondary {#pro3939-sec-8239}

Patients\' medical history is important for the accurate diagnosis of sarcoma. However, the purpose of this assignment is not to provide detailed information about a patient\'s disease. Instead, you should refer to the corresponding APA format given.  \<Patient history of sarcoma in the past, present or future\>

 Read the sources from left to right.

Explain how these sources prove that sopor was a side effect of sleep attacks. A common side effect of sleep attacks is excessive sleepiness and people are often more susceptible to drowsiness or sleepiness with this class of drugs. Explain how you have deduced this from the sources.

Include the following clinical details to assist with your discussion:

· the amount of the drug being taken;

· the duration of the side effects;

· the duration of treatment;

· the signs and symptoms of the side effects and severity of them;
